### Capstone brief

Automate one real process for a Nigerian SME end to end, with an eval set, monitoring, a cost estimate and a handover document the owner signs off.

Your capstone is defended live in front of a panel. Grading: 40% weekly labs, 20% mid-course project, 30% capstone, 10% live defence and AI-use log.', 'project', 4)
