  ('9602be95-ac23-58da-9590-c9abdc504473', 'Python Programming', '🐍', 'From first line of code to a deployed, tested Python application, with debugging and code reading practised every single week. 12 weeks, 3 live sessions a week. For: Complete beginners, graduates, analysts who want to automate. Basic computer literacy only.', true)
