- [ ] The deliverable is saved to your portfolio (GitHub, Behance, Notion or a Power BI link)
- [ ] A short README: the problem, your approach, and the result
- [ ] An AI-use log entry for this week
- [ ] You can explain it to an instructor in 5 minutes

### Capstone brief

Build and deploy a small application for a real use case (school, shop or NGO) with tests, a README, and a live code-walkthrough defence.

Your capstone is defended live in front of a panel. Grading: 40% weekly labs, 20% mid-course project, 30% capstone, 10% live defence and AI-use log.', 'project', 4)
