  ('1e6dc03c-73a1-5c33-9e66-e11f826dd54d', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'UX foundations', 'Covers: Design thinking and the double diamond; UX vs UI vs product roles; Reading a brief: business goals and constraints. Deliverable: Problem statement for a local product.', 'UX Research', 1),
  ('edd30ebf-28da-5851-b813-9a445af6447e', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'User research', 'Covers: Interviews and surveys; Recruiting Nigerian users; consent and ethics; Avoiding leading questions. Deliverable: Interview guide + 5 interviews.', 'UX Research', 2),
  ('a0eacafe-287e-57d6-83ea-3d0519ba5e0b', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Synthesis', 'Covers: Affinity mapping, personas, jobs-to-be-done; Journey maps; Using AI to synthesise, then checking it against raw notes. Deliverable: Persona and journey map with an AI-check note.', 'UX Research', 3),
  ('6ddc125b-f4d7-5cee-a8cc-88fb3ee192bb', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Information architecture', 'Covers: Card sorting and tree testing; Sitemaps and user flows; Navigation patterns. Deliverable: Sitemap and three task flows.', 'UX Research', 4),
  ('ce511dd1-af5d-50fe-b240-979c56519fa1', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Wireframing', 'Covers: Sketching and crazy 8s; Low-fidelity wireframes in Figma; Nielsen''s usability heuristics. Deliverable: Wireframe set + heuristic review.', 'Figma', 5),
  ('72126383-41c0-5c70-802e-e1a67d81bfed', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Visual design and accessibility', 'Covers: Typography, colour, grids, hierarchy; WCAG 2.2 contrast and touch targets; Designing for low-end Android phones. Deliverable: High-fidelity screens (mid-course project).', 'Figma', 6),
  ('d17215df-f132-52b1-b649-657ef0feac74', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Design systems in Figma', 'Covers: Auto layout, components, variants; Variables, modes and tokens; Documenting a mini design system. Deliverable: Component library.', 'Figma', 7),
  ('1849aaa5-1190-5624-974b-e31e18cf232f', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Prototyping', 'Covers: Interactive flows and micro-interactions; Mobile-first and low-bandwidth states; Offline, error and empty states. Deliverable: Clickable prototype.', 'Figma', 8),
  ('17889c1b-1bdb-5bc6-bd3d-ee635696bfa5', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Usability testing', 'Covers: Test plans and tasks; Moderated vs unmoderated testing; Task success, time on task, SUS score. Deliverable: Test report with iteration v2.', 'UX Research', 9),
  ('9f6a253f-b2ac-523a-a1ec-668a7256602c', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Designing AI features and handoff', 'Covers: Designing for AI: trust, errors, explainability; Developer handoff and Dev Mode; Working with engineers and PMs. Deliverable: Handoff file + spec.', 'Figma', 10),
  ('a6689b6c-fe5e-5cb5-b941-4d2c5cb7603c', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Writing case studies', 'Covers: Telling the problem → decision → result story; Showing research and trade-offs; Metrics and what you would do next. Deliverable: Two written case studies.', 'Portfolio', 11),
  ('f4d33250-f34c-51dc-b917-27d5380750f4', '18b17252-cb26-5e94-92d4-a306a0b0044c', 'Capstone and career', 'Covers: Real client redesign; Portfolio review with practitioners; Whiteboard challenge practice. Deliverable: Live portfolio site.', 'Capstone', 12)
