### Capstone brief

Redesign a real product for a Nigerian business or NGO: research, test with at least 5 users, iterate, and present the case study to a panel.

Your capstone is defended live in front of a panel. Grading: 40% weekly labs, 20% mid-course project, 30% capstone, 10% live defence and AI-use log.', 'project', 4)
