### Capstone brief

Automate a company''s month-end close pack (anonymised real data where possible): refreshable inputs, reconciliations, a Power BI management report and a controls memo.

Your capstone is defended live in front of a panel. Grading: 40% weekly labs, 20% mid-course project, 30% capstone, 10% live defence and AI-use log.', 'project', 4)
