### Capstone brief

Run a simulated SOC shift: detect, triage and respond to a staged attack in the lab SIEM, then write the incident report and present it to a panel.

Your capstone is defended live in front of a panel. Grading: 40% weekly labs, 20% mid-course project, 30% capstone, 10% live defence and AI-use log.', 'project', 4)
